# Testing Standards

## Project Structure

```
tests/
  SchoolSaaS.UnitTests/
  SchoolSaaS.IntegrationTests/
  SchoolSaaS.ArchitectureTests/
```

## Unit Tests (xUnit + FluentAssertions + NSubstitute)

- One test class per handler/validator/service
- Naming: `{Method}_{Scenario}_{ExpectedResult}`

```csharp
[Fact]
public async Task Handle_ValidCommand_ReturnsSuccessWithId()
{
    // Arrange — mock IRepository, ITenantContext
    // Act — handler.Handle(command)
    // Assert — result.IsSuccess, result.Value != Guid.Empty
}
```

## Integration Tests (Testcontainers)

- PostgreSQL container per test collection
- Seed tenant + admin user in fixture
- Required per module: `TenantIsolationIntegrationTest`

## Architecture Tests (NetArchTest)

```csharp
[Fact]
public void Application_Should_Not_Reference_Infrastructure() { ... }

[Fact]
public void Commands_Should_Have_RequirePermission_Attribute() { ... }
```

## Coverage Targets (MVP)

- Handlers/validators: 80%+
- Endpoints: integration test per endpoint
- Tenant isolation: 100% of tenant-scoped entities

## Every PR Must Include

- [ ] Unit test for new handler/validator
- [ ] Integration test if DB interaction
- [ ] Tenant isolation test if new entity
